  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────  
  KEYBOARD HELP                                                                                                                   
  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────      
  ↑↓ / j k: move within the focused surface                                                                                       
  ←→ / h l: move between columns, and into/out of Objectives at the edge                                                          
  g: open the Goal selector                                                                                                       
  C: in the Goal selector: close a ready Goal, or reopen a done one                                                               
  1–4: set priority: Critical, High, Medium, Low                                                                                  
  K / shift+↑: move the Objective up within its priority group                                                                    
  J / shift+↓: move the Objective down within its priority group                                                                  
  enter / v: open the focused record                                                                                              
  i / I: open Issues                                                                                                              
  H: open Code Health                                                                                                             
  o: open Advanced Options (optional features); enter/space toggles, esc closes                                                   
  ?: close this help                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                  
  OWNER ACTIONS                                                                                                                   
  p: record selection                                                                                                             
                                                                                                                                  
